<ul><li>Age</li><li>Previous cycles (   cycles    success).</li><li>History of pregnancy.</li><li>BMI 19 – 30.</li></ul>
<h3><strong>Life style Modification:</strong></h3>
<ul><li>Alcohol – 1unit/ days     success.</li><li>Smoking –     success in both partners.</li><li>Maternal caffeine –     success.</li></ul>
<h3><strong>Referral criteria for IVF.</strong></h3>
<ul><li>Discuss risk/benefits according to HEFA code.</li></ul>
<h3><em><strong>Cycles of IVF, ICSI:</strong></em></h3>
<ul><li>Comprises of 1 episode of ovarian stimulation and transfer of resultant fresh/frozen embryo.</li></ul>
