<p>BMI – 40          BMI &gt;35 +</p>
<p>HTN or DM</p>
<h3><strong>        </strong><strong>Bariatric surgery</strong></h3>
<ul><li>Weight loss</li><li>Up to 41 kg.</li><li>Improve Dyslipidemia</li><li>Insulin resistance</li><li>Improve HTN</li><li>Improve Hyperandrogenism</li><li>Over a period of 1 year</li><li>=&gt;Reported mortality 0.1-1.1%</li></ul>
<h3><strong>Reduction in Androgen level:</strong></h3>
<ul><li>Weight reduction (5% weight loss -&gt;     androgen levels).</li><li>Metformin 11%</li><li>Lipid lowering agents.</li><li>OCPS.</li><li>Ovarian drilling.</li></ul>
