<ul><li><strong>&gt;7cmLaparoscopic cystectomyORRe – Scan 3m0 if Asymptomatic&gt;7cmLaparoscopic cystectomyORRe – Scan 3m0 if Asymptomatic</strong><strong>&gt;7cm</strong>Laparoscopic cystectomyORRe – Scan 3m0 if Asymptomatic<strong>&gt;7cm</strong>Laparoscopic cystectomyORRe – Scan 3m0 if Asymptomatic<strong>3 – 5 cmRe – Scan3 monthsResolve          Persists                     Tumor makers MRI3 – 5 cmRe – Scan3 monthsResolve          Persists                     Tumor makers MRI</strong><strong>3 – 5 cm</strong>Re – Scan3 monthsResolve          Persists                     Tumor makers MRI<strong>3 – 5 cm</strong>Re – Scan3 monthsResolve          Persists                     Tumor makers MRI<strong>5 – 7 cm5 – 7 cm</strong><strong>5 – 7 cm</strong><strong>5 – 7 cm</strong>Repeat Scan after</li></ul>
