<p>MSU</p>
<p>A/B treatment.</p>
<p>Recurrent &gt; 3 episodes in year.</p>
<p>Refer to secondary care.</p>
<p>Treatment if</p>
<ul><li>Renal USGabnormality detected</li><li>Voiding studies</li><li>Cystoscopy</li></ul>
<h3><strong>Normal investigations</strong></h3>
