<h3><strong>Recognition:</strong></h3>
<ul><li>Extention of instrument beyond limit</li><li>Loss of vision</li><li>Collapsed uterus</li><li>Large deficient of distetion media.</li></ul>
<h3><strong>Common Sites</strong><strong>: </strong></h3>
