<h3><strong>Neonatal Herpes:</strong></h3>
<ul><li>Skin, eye, mouth = 30%.</li><li>Local CNS = 60%.</li><li>Disseminated = 70%</li><li>No miscarriage.</li><li>No teratogenicity</li></ul>
