<h3><strong>Factors affecting AVB:</strong></h3>
<ul><li>Continuous support    AVB</li><li>Epidural     AVB but less likely with newer techniques</li><li>Epidural in latent phase don’t    risk</li><li>Women in labour should adapt position to reduce AVB</li><li>Upright, lateral – without epidural</li><li>Lateral – with epidural</li><li>To reduce AVB</li><li>Delayed pushing 1 – 2 hours</li><li>Don’t discontinue epidural in 2nd stage</li><li>Don’t use syntocinon routinely in 2nd stage</li><li>Don’t use manual rotation routinely</li></ul>
