ase that was aggravated by pregnancy<em><strong>Direct </strong></em><em><strong>In Direct</strong></em><em><strong>late</strong></em><em><strong>coincidental </strong></em><em>death due to</em><em> </em>Complication of</li></ul>
<p><em><strong> </strong></em>Pregnancy state</p>
<p>labour</p>
<p>puerperium</p>
<p>Pregnancy Intervention</p>
<p>Omission</p>
<p>As a result of treatment</p>
<p>From chain of events of above</p>
<h3><em><strong>Examples:</strong></em></h3>
<ul><li>Haemorrhage</li><li>Sepsis, unsafe abortion</li><li>Eclampsia and its</li><li>complications</li><li>Preeclampsia and its</li><li>Complications</li><li>Ruptured uterus</li><li>Mental health problems,</li><li>suicide</li><li>VTE, <strong>most common</strong></li><li>AF embolism</li></ul>', 1) ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE content=VALUES(content), type=VALUES(type);
